@startuml components
!theme plain
title Диаграмма компонентов — Current (Phase 1-3 MVP)

skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho

skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor #1f2937
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #f9fafb
  BorderColor #1f2937
}
skinparam node {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor #1f2937
}

' ============================================================================
' Browser tier
' ============================================================================

actor "Пользователь" as User

node "Browser" as Browser {
  component "Nuxt 4 SPA\n(skeleton; полноценный UI — Phase 4)" as Spa
}

note bottom of Spa
  Vue 3 + Nuxt UI v4 + (планируется)
  Pinia + ECharts + vue-query
  + Inspira UI + vue-bits.
  В Current: app/app.vue + app/pages/index.vue (заглушка).
  SSE-клиент через `useBoardStream` поверх
  `useEventSource` (@vueuse/core) — Phase 4.
end note

User --> Spa

' ============================================================================
' Application tier
' ============================================================================

node "Nitro Server (1 реплика)" as Nitro {

  component "HTTP API\n(H3 router, ~44 endpoints)" as HttpAPI

  component "Auth + Tenant\n(in-handler guards)" as Guards

  component "Domain Services\n(tasks, sprints, boards,\nworkspaces, analytics, …)" as Services

  component "RBAC helpers\n(server/utils/rbac.ts)" as Rbac

  component "Analytics engine\n(live SQL on task_events)" as Analytics

  component "EventBus\n(in-process EventEmitter,\nserver/utils/events.ts)" as EventBus

  component "SSE hub\n(H3 createEventStream)" as SseHub

  component "Domain Errors + toHttpError\n(server/utils/errors.ts)" as Errors
}

note top of Guards
  RBAC и tenant scoping выполняются
  в начале каждого handler'а как guard-clause.
  Папок server/middleware/, jobs/, ff/ нет —
  это Target (см. ../../06-system-architecture.md).
end note

' ============================================================================
' Data tier
' ============================================================================

database "PostgreSQL 16" as Pg {
  component "Tenant data\n(9 таблиц)" as PgData
  component "RLS на 6 таблицах из 9\n(boards, board_columns, tasks,\ntask_events, sprints, sprint_tasks)" as PgRls
  component "task_events лог\n(append-only)" as PgEvents
}

' ============================================================================
' Связи
' ============================================================================

Spa --> HttpAPI : "HTTPS\nfetch / SSE"

HttpAPI --> Guards
Guards --> Services
Services --> Rbac
Services --> Analytics
Services --> EventBus
Services --> Errors
Analytics ..> PgEvents : "live SQL\nна task_events"
EventBus --> SseHub : "broadcast"
SseHub --> Spa : "EventSource\n(real-time updates)"

Services --> PgData : "withTenant +\nset_config('app.workspace_id', $1, true)"
Services --> PgRls
Services --> PgEvents

' ============================================================================
' Что НЕ реализовано в Current
' ============================================================================

note as TargetNote
  **Не реализовано в Current — см. [06-system-architecture.md](../../06-system-architecture.md) → Target:**

  • Reverse-proxy (Caddy + TLS) — триггер: первый prod-deploy
  • 2+ Nitro реплик — триггер: p95 API latency > 500 мс или > 100 concurrent users
  • Sticky sessions (Caddy) — триггер: появление 2-й реплики Nitro
  • LISTEN/NOTIFY bridge (cross-node SSE fan-out) — триггер: 2-я реплика
  • pg-boss workers (email / webhook / aggregate / MC refresh) — триггер: первый async job
  • Aggregator + flow_daily + materialized views — триггер: p95 analytics > 500 мс при ≥ 100 закрытых задач/мес
  • Object Storage (S3-совместимое: Yandex Object Storage / MinIO) — триггер: реализация attachments / первый prod-клиент
  • External integrations (SMTP, Telegram/Pachca бот, GitFlic) — триггер: первый запрос пользователей
  • Structured logging (pino установлен в package.json, не подключён) — триггер: первый prod-deploy
  • Feature flags (`feature_flags` table + ff.isEnabled) — триггер: второй платный клиент / staged rollout

  Полные триггеры — в Target-секциях 06-system-architecture.md.
end note

@enduml
